{"id":"95643c507a4d6dc3","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-substitution-function.md","title":"数码代入的编码函数","display":"df-substitution-function — 数码代入的编码函数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-substitution-function","aliases":["91-df-substitution-function","91-df-coded-substitution"],"display":"df-substitution-function — 数码代入的编码函数","depends_on":["[[91-df-language-with-truth]]","[[91-df-numeral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-substitution-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-substitution-function</span><span>91-df-coded-substitution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-substitution-function — 数码代入的编码函数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"97fe560478d37064\" href=\"?note=97fe560478d37064\" title=\"91-df-language-with-truth\">91-df-language-with-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"822ef14bbd4e020d\" href=\"?note=822ef14bbd4e020d\" title=\"91-df-numeral\">91-df-numeral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> 是上述有效的一阶语言，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(\\xi)=\\ulcorner\\xi\\urcorner\">\\(g(\\xi)=\\ulcorner\\xi\\urcorner\\)</span> 是单射原始递归句法编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 不编码表达式。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 是任意指定变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi[t/x]\">\\(\\varphi[t/x]\\)</span> 表示无捕获替换，必要时先重命名绑定变量。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline n=S^n(0)\">\\(\\overline n=S^n(0)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"822ef14bbd4e020d\" href=\"?note=822ef14bbd4e020d\" title=\"91-df-numeral\">91-df-numeral</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution\\text{-}function}\\vdash\\quad\n\n\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathcal L}_x(e,n)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\ulcorner\\varphi[\\overline n/x]\\urcorner,&amp;e=\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner,\n\\ \\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L},\\\\\n0,&amp;e\\text{ 不编码公式}.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution\\text{-}function}\\vdash\\quad\n\n\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathcal L}_x(e,n)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\ulcorner\\varphi[\\overline n/x]\\urcorner,&amp;e=\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner,\n\\ \\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L},\\\\\n0,&amp;e\\text{ 不编码公式}.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>它是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 的总原始递归函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}^{\\mathcal L}_x\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}^{\\mathcal L}_x\\)</span> 是其规范算术代表；在 PA 的相应有限定义性扩张中使用该函数项。\n对互异变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\">\\(\\vec x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\)</span> 定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{\\langle\\rangle}(e)=e,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{\\vec x}(e,\\vec n)\n=\\operatorname{Sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{x_k}(\\cdots\\operatorname{Sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{x_1}(e,n_1)\\cdots,n_k).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{\\langle\\rangle}(e)=e,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{\\vec x}(e,\\vec n)\n=\\operatorname{Sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{x_k}(\\cdots\\operatorname{Sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{x_1}(e,n_1)\\cdots,n_k).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\}\\)</span>，则该值编码句子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi[\\overline{n_1}/x_1,\\ldots,\\overline{n_k}/x_k]\">\\(\\varphi[\\overline{n_1}/x_1,\\ldots,\\overline{n_k}/x_k]\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>小写为元层函数，大写为对象算术表示。第一步代入后允许仍有其他自由变量；旧定义只接受至多一个自由变量，会使多参数 UTB 的复合代入错误地落入默认分支。\n数码是闭项，因此互异变量的逐次代入等于同步代入。原始递归性来自固定的句法编码与结构递归。</p>\n<p>来源：§5.1–5.2，印刷页 32–35，PDF 页 43–46。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-language-with-truth","status":"resolved","id":"97fe560478d37064","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-language-with-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"822ef14bbd4e020d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"822ef14bbd4e020d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\overline n=S^n(0)$，见 [[91-df-numeral]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"g(\\xi)=\\ulcorner\\xi\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi[t/x]","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline n=S^n(0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution\\text{-}function}\\vdash\\quad\n\n\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathcal L}_x(e,n)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\ulcorner\\varphi[\\overline n/x]\\urcorner,&e=\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner,\n\\ \\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L},\\\\\n0,&e\\text{ 不编码公式}.\n\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}^{\\mathcal L}_x","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{\\langle\\rangle}(e)=e,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{\\vec x}(e,\\vec n)\n=\\operatorname{Sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{x_k}(\\cdots\\operatorname{Sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{x_1}(e,n_1)\\cdots,n_k).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi[\\overline{n_1}/x_1,\\ldots,\\overline{n_k}/x_k]","display":false}],"bytes":2051,"backlinks":[{"id":"38c875c58a0bf84c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b31ce2c72a177855","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"fa1e29f5683a4d6f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"08a0ab6453addb52","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"30584c32b5f9ed53","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7f2540086a62d464","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-49","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-substitution-function]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-substitution-function]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-87","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-coded-syntax.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[9